WEBVTT

00:20.350 --> 00:24.390
♪ As flowers bloom and wither ♪

00:24.390 --> 00:30.090
♪ May we pass by the magnificent scenery ♪

00:30.980 --> 00:35.140
♪ Contemplate the vastness
of Heaven and Earth ♪

00:35.140 --> 00:40.910
♪ Could it be that both of us
are filled with desolation? ♪

00:41.790 --> 00:45.630
♪ As flowers bloom and wither ♪

00:45.630 --> 00:51.400
♪ May we lead such a life ♪

00:52.350 --> 00:56.520
♪ Contemplate the vastness
of Heaven and Earth ♪

00:56.520 --> 01:01.900
♪ Turning back, you and I ♪

01:05.740 --> 01:07.270
♪ Seize the current moment ♪

01:07.270 --> 01:10.920
♪ The sky is painted
with a gentle pallet of pastel colors ♪

01:10.920 --> 01:15.920
♪ Let's walk together ♪

01:16.360 --> 01:17.970
♪ Even if ♪

01:17.970 --> 01:21.660
♪ The snow in front of us ♪

01:21.680 --> 01:23.170
♪ Will dye our hair white ♪

01:23.170 --> 01:27.210
♪ In an instant ♪

01:27.210 --> 01:28.310
[Joy of Life Season 2]

01:28.310 --> 01:30.780
[Adapted from Mao Ni's Joy of Life
on Yuewen Group's Qidian platform]

01:30.780 --> 01:34.300
[Episode 21]

01:35.759 --> 01:38.199
Stop calling me savior.

01:41.640 --> 01:42.720
Understood,

01:43.280 --> 01:44.360
Mr. Fan.

01:48.239 --> 01:49.520
What do you understand?

01:50.000 --> 01:51.320
From now on,

01:51.720 --> 01:53.299
I will only keep my gratitude

01:53.319 --> 01:54.960
deep inside.

01:55.959 --> 01:57.240
I will not

01:58.360 --> 01:59.759
mention it ever again.

02:02.840 --> 02:04.080
Show me the way.

02:04.319 --> 02:05.659
I have a lot on my plate.

02:05.679 --> 02:07.160
This way, please, Mr. Fan.

02:23.200 --> 02:25.939
Fan Xian exposed
the tampered ranking list

02:25.959 --> 02:27.720
to His Majesty?

02:29.080 --> 02:30.280
That's not all.

02:30.600 --> 02:33.750
His Majesty then tasked him
with the past exam corruption investigation.

02:35.320 --> 02:37.680
After all, your disciple

02:37.760 --> 02:39.720
is involved.

02:41.040 --> 02:42.120
Mother,

02:42.519 --> 02:44.160
I think Fan Xian is right.

02:44.200 --> 02:45.820
This is not my doing.

02:45.840 --> 02:47.020
It could be a potential danger,

02:47.040 --> 02:48.799
so it's better to bring it to light.

02:49.040 --> 02:50.440
As for the disciple,

02:50.839 --> 02:52.479
I have plenty of them.

02:52.999 --> 02:54.759
Be that as it may,

02:55.920 --> 02:58.160
your reputation has been affected.

03:00.559 --> 03:02.320
What reputation do I have?

03:02.640 --> 03:04.280
You are the Crown Prince.

03:04.959 --> 03:06.680
Precisely because of this identity,

03:06.880 --> 03:08.680
I can't regard my reputation too highly.

03:13.950 --> 03:19.695
[Imperial Inspectorate]

03:25.439 --> 03:26.519
Where are they?

03:28.439 --> 03:29.519
Who?

03:29.800 --> 03:32.080
Didn't you order Deng to take them
and seal the exam hall?

03:32.080 --> 03:32.780
Oh, right.

03:32.800 --> 03:34.099
I'm so forgetful.

03:34.119 --> 03:35.020
Give them to me.

03:35.040 --> 03:36.320
Please don't, Mr. Fan.

03:36.640 --> 03:37.260
I'm good.

03:37.280 --> 03:39.180
Let me carry the things from the palace
for a while more.

03:39.200 --> 03:41.580
I need you to send a message
to Deng Ziyue.

03:41.600 --> 03:43.799
The result announcement
mustn't be delayed.

03:45.719 --> 03:47.460
What about the ranking list?

03:47.480 --> 03:49.799
We need to change
Yang Wanli's name back.

03:50.559 --> 03:51.919
Who will do that?

03:56.439 --> 03:57.919
No way.

04:07.999 --> 04:08.939
Wait.

04:08.959 --> 04:10.400
There are so many characters.

04:12.839 --> 04:15.340
Can't we cross off this name

04:15.360 --> 04:19.120
and add Yang Wanli's name?

04:19.559 --> 04:21.719
That sounds quite right.

04:21.840 --> 04:23.299
Still, this is the honor roll.

04:23.319 --> 04:25.619
I don't think it's appropriate

04:25.639 --> 04:27.159
to make amendments to it.

04:28.999 --> 04:30.159
True, though.

04:31.759 --> 04:32.679
The thing is...

04:32.679 --> 04:35.680
What if I make a mistake?

04:36.079 --> 04:38.739
Qinian, look on the bright side.

04:38.759 --> 04:40.120
What bright side?

04:42.119 --> 04:43.440
For instance,

04:43.679 --> 04:45.380
you are the first man

04:45.400 --> 04:48.199
to handwrite the honor roll
in history.

04:49.840 --> 04:51.079
That's true.

04:51.999 --> 04:53.399
But I...

04:53.520 --> 04:55.380
Wait. But if I make a mistake...

04:55.400 --> 04:56.859
Deng, you do it.

04:56.879 --> 04:57.900
That won't do.

04:57.920 --> 04:59.700
Mr. Fan gave you this task.

04:59.720 --> 05:01.659
No. Your handwriting
is better than mine.

05:01.679 --> 05:03.140
I'm also luckier than you.

05:03.160 --> 05:04.700
I don't have to do this.

05:04.720 --> 05:05.800
You!

05:47.079 --> 05:47.920
By right,

05:47.920 --> 05:50.800
the Ministry of Rites
should take charge of this.

05:56.600 --> 05:57.859
Mr. Fan said

05:57.879 --> 05:59.500
the Ministry of Rites

05:59.520 --> 06:01.460
handles this every year.

06:01.480 --> 06:03.059
They are tired.

06:03.079 --> 06:04.179
So this year,

06:04.199 --> 06:07.360
we shall share their burden.

06:12.920 --> 06:15.800
Why do we need a huge canvas?

06:17.040 --> 06:18.880
Mr. Fan also said

06:19.480 --> 06:20.979
the current spring exam

06:20.999 --> 06:23.059
must be fair.

06:23.079 --> 06:25.179
This huge canvas is used

06:25.199 --> 06:28.639
to declare the absolute fairness
of the exam.

06:43.430 --> 06:44.859
Since this honor roll is so important,

06:44.879 --> 06:47.599
Mr. Fan should write this himself.

06:47.920 --> 06:49.859
Try thinking before you speak, will you?

06:49.879 --> 06:51.480
You see, Mr. Fan's chicken scratch...

06:54.520 --> 06:55.380
Indeed.

06:55.400 --> 06:58.599
It could be quite a disgrace.

06:59.239 --> 07:00.320
Besides,

07:00.639 --> 07:02.599
Mr. Fan is busy.

07:02.800 --> 07:05.900
His Majesty tasked him

07:05.920 --> 07:07.619
with all the spring exam
corruption cases.

07:07.639 --> 07:09.399
He is working on that at the moment.

07:13.400 --> 07:15.140
These are old cases.

07:15.160 --> 07:16.800
Where should he start?

07:17.960 --> 07:20.059
Can you stop talking?

07:20.079 --> 07:21.780
You are affecting me.

07:21.800 --> 07:23.719
I'm worried about Mr. Fan.

07:24.439 --> 07:25.580
He's in the dungeon.

07:25.600 --> 07:26.460
Dungeon?

07:26.480 --> 07:26.999
Which dungeon?

07:26.999 --> 07:29.160
First Division's.

07:29.160 --> 07:30.959
Just shut up already, please.

07:38.559 --> 07:40.719
Look. Is it skewed?

07:44.679 --> 07:47.140
Qinian, there is nothing to tell.

07:47.160 --> 07:49.320
Can't you see?

07:50.480 --> 07:52.360
I really can't.

07:54.559 --> 07:55.839
Whatever.

08:21.267 --> 08:23.196
[Yang Wanli]

08:39.640 --> 08:41.199
Why are you here?

08:41.240 --> 08:42.320
Me?

08:42.920 --> 08:44.260
To keep my father company.

08:44.520 --> 08:45.100
No,

08:45.120 --> 08:47.959
I mean, how did you get in the dungeon?

08:48.280 --> 08:49.500
I talked to Wang Qinian.

08:49.520 --> 08:50.959
And he let you in?

08:51.079 --> 08:52.140
He didn't agree at first.

08:52.160 --> 08:53.160
And?

08:53.180 --> 08:54.380
Then, I posed some questions.

08:54.400 --> 08:55.480
I asked him,

08:55.719 --> 08:58.939
"Is this a secret mission
that I returned to the Capital?"

08:58.959 --> 08:59.659
Of course.

08:59.679 --> 09:01.040
He said that too.

09:01.359 --> 09:02.459
Then, I asked him again,

09:02.479 --> 09:03.760
"If that's the case,

09:03.760 --> 09:06.119
I mustn't let anyone find me.

09:06.559 --> 09:09.179
Isn't the dungeon a suitable place?"

09:09.199 --> 09:10.599
How could you say such...

09:11.640 --> 09:13.179
Such a reasonable thing.

09:13.199 --> 09:14.659
I also told him

09:14.679 --> 09:17.760
that Fan Xian is seeking
my father's help now.

09:18.520 --> 09:21.299
In case he wants to kill my father
after the deal is done,

09:21.319 --> 09:23.220
I shouldn't run away.

09:23.240 --> 09:24.819
So I want to stay with my father

09:24.839 --> 09:25.699
in the dungeon.

09:25.719 --> 09:29.040
If you really plan to kill him,
this just works out for us both.

09:36.350 --> 09:37.520
Father, please.

09:42.040 --> 09:43.850
Hence, Wang Qinian let me in.

09:43.870 --> 09:45.170
Please drink some tea.

09:48.160 --> 09:51.040
Aren't you afraid
that I will kill your father?

09:53.040 --> 09:54.680
You are not that kind of person.

09:55.080 --> 09:56.120
You seem to have much trust in me.

09:56.120 --> 09:58.359
It's not about trust or anything,

09:58.520 --> 10:00.999
I just want to be with my father.

10:03.839 --> 10:06.330
Mr. Fan, I shall thank you

10:06.350 --> 10:08.760
for transferring me here
from the Ministry of Justice.

10:08.800 --> 10:11.320
The First Division is more comfortable.

10:11.479 --> 10:12.860
You won't stay here for long.

10:12.880 --> 10:13.939
Don't worry.

10:13.959 --> 10:15.079
I won't kill you.

10:16.160 --> 10:17.359
In fact,

10:17.520 --> 10:18.620
I do know a thing or two

10:18.640 --> 10:20.480
about these cases.

10:20.500 --> 10:22.130
Do you suggest I investigate them?

10:24.120 --> 10:26.659
Yes.

10:26.679 --> 10:27.759
But?

10:28.599 --> 10:31.280
But there isn't much you can do
once the truth is uncovered.

10:31.439 --> 10:32.459
When all is said and done,

10:32.479 --> 10:35.140
only a few can pull the string
in the spring exam.

10:35.160 --> 10:37.439
The Crown Prince, princes,
the Elder Princess,

10:37.439 --> 10:39.719
Prime Minister Lin, Mr. Chen,

10:40.040 --> 10:41.819
and General Qin.

10:41.839 --> 10:42.999
None of them

10:43.479 --> 10:45.020
can be penalized.

10:45.040 --> 10:46.599
Don't worry. I'm not that clueless.

10:47.120 --> 10:49.440
I don't want to pull these big shots
into the mud.

10:50.439 --> 10:52.359
You are wise, Mr. Fan.

10:57.959 --> 10:59.560
Those big shots are untouchable.

10:59.600 --> 11:01.270
But there are these errand runners.

11:03.510 --> 11:04.740
They act on the big shot's behalf

11:04.760 --> 11:06.179
and take bribes.

11:06.199 --> 11:08.079
It's plenty of them.

11:08.800 --> 11:10.119
I will target some.

11:11.199 --> 11:12.620
At the very least, this might discourage

11:12.640 --> 11:15.119
those with ill intentions
for a few years

11:15.199 --> 11:17.359
and uphold fairness to some extent.

11:19.280 --> 11:21.280
Those errand runners in question

11:21.719 --> 11:23.330
are mostly from the Ministry of Rites.

11:23.350 --> 11:25.760
Are there more honest
or corrupt officials among them?

11:26.280 --> 11:27.220
Mr. Fan,

11:27.240 --> 11:29.939
does taking fewer bribes
make them honest officials?

11:29.959 --> 11:31.059
Please don't joke, Mr. Guo.

11:31.079 --> 11:33.160
You started this first.

11:35.800 --> 11:37.450
If so, I will investigate them
one by one.

11:37.470 --> 11:38.980
I won't let any guilty hands

11:39.000 --> 11:40.160
off the hook.

11:41.760 --> 11:43.119
In that case,

11:43.679 --> 11:45.239
I will provide you with a list.

11:45.839 --> 11:47.659
It will be less taxing

11:47.679 --> 11:50.239
to start with those careless ones.

11:50.960 --> 11:52.360
Thank you for your trouble.

11:54.079 --> 11:55.800
In fact, the victims in these cases

11:56.280 --> 11:58.400
deserve more attention.

11:58.800 --> 12:00.400
What victims?

12:01.479 --> 12:03.140
Candidates who are being framed,

12:03.160 --> 12:04.719
bribed,

12:04.880 --> 12:07.239
and having their names substituted

12:07.679 --> 12:08.939
are the victims.

12:08.959 --> 12:09.800
After all,

12:09.820 --> 12:12.220
someone needs to be held accountable
for the tragic case.

12:13.679 --> 12:15.320
Thank you for your reminder, Mr. Guo.

12:18.079 --> 12:19.560
No need to thank me.

12:20.280 --> 12:22.239
It's those candidates

12:22.479 --> 12:24.260
who need to thank you, Mr. Fan.

12:24.280 --> 12:25.479
That's too much.

12:25.840 --> 12:27.299
Eradicating inherited problems

12:27.319 --> 12:29.920
and restoring justice to all candidates,

12:30.079 --> 12:32.870
no words are too much
to express their gratitude.

12:46.240 --> 12:46.940
Who asks for me?

12:46.960 --> 12:48.280
He's at the entrance.

12:51.559 --> 12:52.819
Little Xian!

12:52.839 --> 12:54.040
Dabao?

12:54.839 --> 12:55.440
Come on in.

12:55.460 --> 12:56.830
[Lin Dabao, eldest son of Lin Ruofu]
Come out.

12:56.839 --> 12:57.740
Come in.

12:57.760 --> 12:58.760
Come on out.

12:58.760 --> 13:00.079
Come on in.

13:00.359 --> 13:01.959
Please come out!

13:01.959 --> 13:03.100
I will come out if you come in.

13:03.120 --> 13:05.539
But I can't! Please come out.

13:05.559 --> 13:06.640
Chop-chop.

13:09.000 --> 13:11.320
Why didn't you go in there?

13:11.760 --> 13:12.740
I can't.

13:12.760 --> 13:14.459
This is your workplace.

13:14.479 --> 13:16.939
If I do silly things inside there,

13:16.959 --> 13:18.140
people might laugh at you.

13:18.160 --> 13:19.240
You will be embarrassed.

13:19.240 --> 13:20.940
Nonsense! No one is laughing at you.

13:20.960 --> 13:21.559
Let's go inside.

13:21.559 --> 13:22.100
No.

13:22.120 --> 13:24.179
I can't go inside.
I just came here to visit you.

13:24.199 --> 13:25.520
Who brought you here?

13:26.640 --> 13:28.599
Yuan!

13:29.520 --> 13:30.800
It's Mr. Yuan.

13:31.199 --> 13:32.179
Only him?

13:32.199 --> 13:34.320
Father doesn't worry
if Mr. Yuan accompanies me.

13:34.400 --> 13:35.380
I bet he does.

13:35.400 --> 13:37.699
Little Xian, do you have time now?

13:37.719 --> 13:39.400
Father wants to treat you to some tea.

13:46.359 --> 13:47.620
If Mr. Lin wants to see me,

13:47.640 --> 13:49.500
he could've sent for me.

13:49.520 --> 13:51.520
Dabao doesn't have
to come here personally.

13:51.920 --> 13:54.520
Dabao misses you.

13:56.439 --> 13:58.160
Dabao is simple.

13:58.679 --> 14:00.719
He might get picked on easily.

14:01.599 --> 14:04.040
Mr. Fan, please look after him

14:04.520 --> 14:05.959
in the future.

14:06.440 --> 14:08.000
Does that mean something else?

14:10.240 --> 14:12.560
No, you have overthought.

14:13.520 --> 14:15.479
I have an errand to run.

14:16.359 --> 14:18.119
Mr. Fan,

14:18.319 --> 14:20.079
please accompany Dabao home.

14:20.439 --> 14:21.599
Sure, go ahead.

14:23.240 --> 14:24.359
Don't worry.

14:24.880 --> 14:27.320
I will protect Dabao
even if you didn't say so.

14:32.640 --> 14:34.620
What's wrong with Mr. Yuan?

14:34.640 --> 14:35.959
He seems weird today.

14:38.319 --> 14:39.760
Is it because

14:39.920 --> 14:41.839
his sugar doll is too small?

14:43.120 --> 14:44.239
Maybe.

14:47.679 --> 14:49.079
His Majesty assigned you

14:49.559 --> 14:52.440
to look into the unresolved spring exam
corruption cases.

14:54.319 --> 14:55.959
Word spreads fast, indeed.

14:57.520 --> 14:59.079
Truth be told,

14:59.520 --> 15:00.920
over the past years,

15:01.400 --> 15:04.280
I did have slotted quite a few of my men

15:04.880 --> 15:07.800
into the honor roll.

15:08.920 --> 15:12.119
If you are to investigate,
start with me.

15:13.719 --> 15:14.920
Stop staring at me.

15:16.000 --> 15:17.479
I'm not testing you.

15:18.040 --> 15:19.280
I'm serious.

15:22.319 --> 15:23.800
Seriously?

15:26.510 --> 15:27.939
News started circulating in the Capital

15:27.959 --> 15:31.320
right after you picked up the slack.
Do you know why?

15:32.800 --> 15:36.719
His Majesty is preparing you
for the Imperial Treasury takeover

15:36.959 --> 15:39.400
with this influential case.

15:40.640 --> 15:41.720
I know.

15:42.120 --> 15:43.260
Mr. Chen reminded me

15:43.280 --> 15:44.879
in the inner hall this morning.

15:45.079 --> 15:46.800
What are you going to do?

15:47.800 --> 15:49.390
If you were to investigate this,

15:49.559 --> 15:50.999
who would you look into?

15:51.920 --> 15:54.199
It will be a huge trouble in any event

15:54.400 --> 15:57.160
and might end up making lots of foes
if you are careless enough.

15:57.800 --> 15:59.560
If that's the case,

15:59.839 --> 16:01.839
why don't you investigate me?

16:02.000 --> 16:04.220
I will prepare a few people in advance

16:04.240 --> 16:05.959
for you.

16:06.520 --> 16:09.119
So that you can answer to His Majesty

16:09.319 --> 16:10.719
and

16:11.199 --> 16:13.280
I won't go too harshly on you.

16:14.120 --> 16:15.479
Tenacious officials

16:15.640 --> 16:17.239
always end up

16:17.719 --> 16:19.520
with a grim fate.

16:21.040 --> 16:23.640
Mr. Lin, you are like a candle.

16:24.520 --> 16:25.740
What is that?

16:25.760 --> 16:28.339
You burn yourself to light my way.

16:28.359 --> 16:30.079
Load of bull.

16:31.040 --> 16:32.479
Nonsense.

16:34.079 --> 16:36.479
I haven't had a chance
to thank you, Mr. Lin.

16:36.880 --> 16:39.560
You were so considerate
during the spring exam.

16:44.599 --> 16:46.520
You did a good job.

16:47.040 --> 16:48.640
You didn't use

16:48.679 --> 16:50.280
any of my arrangements.

16:50.839 --> 16:52.999
It's the thought that counts.

16:54.800 --> 16:56.520
I'm in the second-highest position

16:56.599 --> 16:58.160
in the country.

16:58.599 --> 17:02.160
I will try my best to protect you
while I still can.

17:03.719 --> 17:05.679
You need some time

17:06.040 --> 17:08.020
to take root

17:08.040 --> 17:09.260
and branch out widely

17:09.280 --> 17:11.839
before you can protect the Lin family.

17:16.119 --> 17:17.359
I will not let you down.

17:17.919 --> 17:20.520
No need to take it too seriously.

17:21.359 --> 17:23.679
I won't stand down so soon.

17:24.040 --> 17:25.579
Don't worry.

17:25.599 --> 17:28.639
I will always be there for you.

17:32.000 --> 17:33.839
Where did Mr. Yuan go?

17:34.480 --> 17:36.520
I'm waiting for him to finish this game.

17:38.159 --> 17:40.280
If I withdraw this stone,

17:40.639 --> 17:42.760
I might win the game.

17:43.639 --> 17:45.879
Mr. Yuan went out for an errand,
didn't he?

17:46.480 --> 17:47.420
What errand?

17:47.440 --> 17:48.460
I don't know.

17:48.480 --> 17:49.240
Wasn't that your order?

17:49.240 --> 17:51.079
Was he meeting a man or a woman?

17:51.240 --> 17:52.919
Search me.

17:54.520 --> 17:56.159
Mr. Yuan

17:56.559 --> 17:58.579
may appear decent,

17:58.599 --> 18:01.520
but I know him to be otherwise.

18:02.520 --> 18:03.559
Do you think

18:03.559 --> 18:05.460
he hides a woman outside?

18:05.480 --> 18:06.679
Um...

18:07.159 --> 18:08.359
Do you have a mistress outside?

18:08.359 --> 18:09.520
No!

18:09.680 --> 18:10.700
I only like Wan'er.

18:10.720 --> 18:11.440
Si Lili?

18:11.440 --> 18:12.020
No!

18:12.040 --> 18:13.119
Haitang Duoduo?

18:13.119 --> 18:14.199
No!

18:15.839 --> 18:18.760
And Yuan Meng
of the Baoyue Pleasure House?

18:19.000 --> 18:20.800
It just can't be her!

18:21.520 --> 18:23.800
It can't be her?

18:24.440 --> 18:26.399
Neither the first two!

18:26.520 --> 18:29.159
Mr. Lin, that was a quick bluff.

19:20.639 --> 19:22.320
Finally, you came.

19:41.000 --> 19:42.439
Did it exhaust you so much?

19:43.040 --> 19:44.879
Of course.

19:45.520 --> 19:47.560
It was a huge canvas.

19:47.839 --> 19:51.159
I was writing each stroke
with great tension.

19:52.119 --> 19:53.879
A tiny mistake...

19:55.040 --> 19:56.819
Oh, this is not tiny.

19:56.839 --> 19:58.760
The pain eases all of a sudden.

20:00.520 --> 20:02.030
Did you finish all the names?

20:02.639 --> 20:03.720
Yes.

20:03.800 --> 20:05.819
Finally, Yang Wanli's name

20:05.839 --> 20:07.399
returns to its place.

20:07.520 --> 20:08.180
Good, then.

20:08.200 --> 20:09.780
Announce the results as planned.

20:09.800 --> 20:11.440
Don't you take a look at it?

20:11.440 --> 20:12.639
No need.

20:13.079 --> 20:14.220
But this is important.

20:14.240 --> 20:15.439
I believe you.

20:17.280 --> 20:18.760
Hearing what you said,

20:19.200 --> 20:20.760
I feel

20:21.879 --> 20:24.819
like a sinking boat
met a floating plank.

20:24.839 --> 20:26.639
Like encountering a warm sun
in harsh winter.

20:26.639 --> 20:28.760
Enough of pleasantries.

20:30.440 --> 20:31.520
Mr. Fan.

20:31.639 --> 20:34.299
I found something
about the Yingzhou case

20:34.319 --> 20:35.480
you requested.

20:35.680 --> 20:36.960
Back then,

20:37.399 --> 20:40.280
the entire Chen clan was eliminated.

20:41.559 --> 20:42.639
All right.

20:43.280 --> 20:44.180
Besides,

20:44.200 --> 20:48.020
news about you taking charge
of the exam corrupt cases

20:48.040 --> 20:49.220
has been

20:49.240 --> 20:51.679
making the rounds among the people.

20:52.040 --> 20:54.099
Mr. Fan,

20:54.119 --> 20:56.539
all literary men regard you

20:56.559 --> 20:59.560
as the savior of the world

20:59.673 --> 21:01.672
and the eternal light.

21:04.359 --> 21:05.740
That's a bit of a stretch.

21:05.760 --> 21:07.370
The thing is,

21:07.390 --> 21:08.280
it seems that these rumors

21:08.280 --> 21:11.119
came from the Imperial Inspectorate.

21:11.559 --> 21:13.660
His Majesty instructed Mr. Chen

21:13.680 --> 21:15.159
to do so.

21:17.720 --> 21:18.700
Mr. Fan,

21:18.720 --> 21:22.059
is this an opportunity given to you

21:22.079 --> 21:24.240
to lead the literary community?

21:26.440 --> 21:28.639
I really can't tell.

21:29.800 --> 21:31.720
Offering such a prestigious reputation

21:31.960 --> 21:33.720
to an isolated official,

21:33.879 --> 21:35.960
I wonder what His Majesty wants to do.

21:38.599 --> 21:41.460
Wang, I used to think I could
run intellectual rings

21:41.480 --> 21:43.399
around other people.

21:44.520 --> 21:46.520
However, His Majesty

21:47.720 --> 21:49.560
is a real mystery.

21:56.440 --> 21:57.560
Your Majesty,

21:58.240 --> 22:01.030
Fan Xian has taken the unsolved
spring exam corruption cases.

22:01.050 --> 22:02.599
The witnesses are ready to show up
at any time.

22:02.599 --> 22:05.879
Your Majesty,
when will you need them to appear?

22:06.190 --> 22:07.819
Don't affect the results announcement.

22:07.839 --> 22:08.919
Understood.

22:09.559 --> 22:11.520
I will do it after the announcement.

22:15.559 --> 22:18.079
Can Fan Xian handle

22:19.839 --> 22:21.420
the consequences of the investigation?

22:21.440 --> 22:22.679
He has no choice.

22:24.200 --> 22:26.560
Why don't you offer some advice?

22:27.720 --> 22:29.720
You didn't give any orders.

22:36.639 --> 22:38.560
It's not like you are a puppet.

22:39.919 --> 22:41.040
I

22:41.919 --> 22:43.399
can be a puppet.

23:02.040 --> 23:04.200
Out of the nine arrows,

23:04.559 --> 23:05.760
all of them missed.

23:06.760 --> 23:07.840
Well,

23:08.359 --> 23:09.439
I will

23:09.639 --> 23:11.399
give you one more arrow.

23:12.680 --> 23:16.320
Didn't you say you would obey my order?

23:16.559 --> 23:17.639
Take this.

23:19.000 --> 23:20.159
I

23:20.359 --> 23:21.500
order you

23:21.520 --> 23:23.599
to throw it into the pot.

23:26.399 --> 23:27.480
I'm

23:28.960 --> 23:30.179
not good at this.

23:30.199 --> 23:31.359
Throw it.

23:56.119 --> 23:57.199
Your Majesty,

23:57.639 --> 23:59.000
bingo!

24:14.639 --> 24:16.460
It's already this late.

24:16.480 --> 24:18.240
You must be tired, Mr. Chen.

24:19.599 --> 24:22.740
Mr. Chen, I can see
that you are in a good mood today.

24:22.760 --> 24:24.599
You can see that?

24:25.359 --> 24:26.480
You have keen eyes.

24:26.800 --> 24:27.880
You flatter me.

24:28.200 --> 24:29.460
Let me escort you out of the palace.

24:29.480 --> 24:31.119
I know the way.

24:56.559 --> 24:58.240
An attached heart

24:59.839 --> 25:01.200
can only

25:02.240 --> 25:04.200
be a nuisance.

25:13.399 --> 25:14.500
Be patient.

25:14.520 --> 25:15.660
With your knowledge,

25:15.680 --> 25:17.399
you will definitely succeed.

25:17.559 --> 25:18.839
You flatter me.

25:28.040 --> 25:29.120
Shi,

25:29.839 --> 25:31.240
isn't too late

25:31.480 --> 25:32.960
to read now?

25:36.440 --> 25:37.220
You are right.

25:37.240 --> 25:38.139
Shi.

25:38.159 --> 25:39.239
You are here.

25:39.919 --> 25:41.270
Where is Cheng Jialing?

25:42.280 --> 25:43.940
It's crowded here.
I don't know where he is.

25:43.960 --> 25:45.800
Don't worry, he must be here.

25:46.079 --> 25:46.610
You know what?

25:46.630 --> 25:49.270
The Imperial Inspectorate announces
the result without the Ministry of Rites.

25:49.280 --> 25:50.559
This is unprecedented.

25:50.560 --> 25:52.260
With Mr. Fan's endeavor
to preserve clean governance,

25:52.280 --> 25:54.139
the Qing State has undoubtedly
been reinvigorated.

25:54.159 --> 25:55.299
Yang Wanli?

25:55.319 --> 25:56.339
Is it Yang Wanli?

25:56.359 --> 25:58.020
Yes, it's him.

25:58.040 --> 25:58.819
Are you sure?

25:58.839 --> 25:59.980
- Exactly.
- Yang.

26:00.000 --> 26:01.260
I got wind

26:01.280 --> 26:02.899
that the Imperial Inspectorate
is announcing

26:02.919 --> 26:04.930
because they added his name back.

26:04.950 --> 26:06.220
This place was his in the first place.

26:06.240 --> 26:07.500
Someone replaced him.

26:07.520 --> 26:09.020
Mr. Fan found it unfair,

26:09.040 --> 26:10.539
that's why the fuss.

26:10.559 --> 26:11.960
I see.

26:12.040 --> 26:13.139
No wonder.

26:13.159 --> 26:13.980
I told you so.

26:14.000 --> 26:15.919
This is unprecedented.

26:15.960 --> 26:17.200
Uh...

26:17.440 --> 26:19.139
Don't believe in street rumors.

26:19.159 --> 26:21.980
So Mr. Fan sought an audience
with His Majesty because of you.

26:22.000 --> 26:23.379
It's just street rumors.

26:23.399 --> 26:24.559
Do you know

26:24.559 --> 26:25.839
who wrote Yang Wanli's name

26:25.839 --> 26:27.059
back on the honor roll?

26:27.079 --> 26:27.700
Who was it?

26:27.720 --> 26:28.660
Mr. Fan?

26:28.680 --> 26:29.859
It's His Majesty.

26:29.879 --> 26:32.339
His Majesty personally corrected
his name back on overnight.

26:32.359 --> 26:33.260
Who told you this?

26:33.280 --> 26:34.700
Everyone is saying this.

26:34.720 --> 26:35.780
Yang, this is impressive.

26:35.800 --> 26:37.020
These are just baseless rumors.

26:37.040 --> 26:38.260
Baseless rumors.

26:38.280 --> 26:39.360
I'm just lucky.

26:55.839 --> 26:56.740
They are here.

26:56.760 --> 26:57.840
They are here!

27:07.040 --> 27:08.800
Mr. Deng is here.

27:10.040 --> 27:12.639
I wish you a dream come true!

27:16.280 --> 27:18.560
It's going to unroll!

27:38.520 --> 27:40.260
Don't you think
the characters are kind of skewed?

27:40.280 --> 27:41.280
Who cares?

27:41.280 --> 27:42.280
It seems this ranking list

27:42.280 --> 27:43.960
is fair enough.

27:44.079 --> 27:45.819
I made it!

27:45.839 --> 27:46.520
I made it!

27:46.520 --> 27:48.000
I failed again.

27:48.000 --> 27:49.460
I made it too!

27:49.480 --> 27:50.560
Yang!

27:50.919 --> 27:51.599
Yang Wanli!

27:51.599 --> 27:52.590
Where is my name?

27:52.610 --> 27:54.020
The metropolitan graduate
ranked fifth!

27:54.040 --> 27:55.460
You are in the front row!

27:55.480 --> 27:56.740
There is no ranking

27:56.760 --> 27:58.700
in the metropolitan exam.

27:58.720 --> 28:00.720
Just shout it out as you want.

28:03.240 --> 28:04.559
Don't you think

28:04.559 --> 28:06.440
[Yang Wanli of Jiangnan Circuit in Quanzhou]
that three characters look particularly different?

28:06.440 --> 28:07.700
It seems so.

28:07.720 --> 28:09.260
It's full of vigor.

28:09.280 --> 28:10.780
It must be written by His Majesty.

28:10.800 --> 28:11.800
His Majesty wrote it.

28:11.800 --> 28:13.720
The ranking list is fair enough.

28:13.839 --> 28:16.079
It's over for me!

28:17.879 --> 28:21.339
I have tried for years
but still end up failing.

28:21.359 --> 28:24.020
What a frustrating life!

28:24.040 --> 28:25.159
I made it too!

28:25.159 --> 28:27.740
My efforts have paid off!

28:27.760 --> 28:29.280
Old man!

28:30.159 --> 28:31.800
Don't let your success go wasted!

28:34.520 --> 28:36.200
Hou, your name is also in the front row!

28:36.200 --> 28:37.099
Where?

28:37.119 --> 28:38.000
Hou Jichang!

28:38.000 --> 28:40.095
[Hou Jichang
of Hebei Circuit in Jingzhou]

28:42.319 --> 28:44.000
I can't believe I made it!

28:44.760 --> 28:45.460
Let's look for yours

28:45.480 --> 28:46.260
and Jialing's name.

28:46.280 --> 28:47.360
Right.

28:52.940 --> 28:54.200
I made it too!

28:54.290 --> 28:54.800
I made it!

28:54.800 --> 28:56.240
- You made it!
- I made it!

28:57.680 --> 28:58.879
I passed!

28:59.000 --> 29:00.139
Shi... Shi...

29:00.159 --> 29:00.720
Shi Chanli.

29:00.720 --> 29:01.819
Cheng Jialing!

29:01.839 --> 29:02.700
It's Cheng Jialing.

29:02.720 --> 29:04.159
He's made it to the cut-off!

29:04.200 --> 29:05.539
I almost overlooked his name.

29:05.559 --> 29:07.020
As long as he passed.

29:07.040 --> 29:08.599
- Shi.
- Shi Chanli.

29:08.760 --> 29:09.760
Shi Chanli.

29:09.760 --> 29:11.520
Shi... Shi Chanli.

29:15.040 --> 29:15.859
Calm down.

29:15.879 --> 29:16.940
Perhaps we missed it.

29:16.960 --> 29:17.579
Let's try again.

29:17.599 --> 29:18.370
Right.

29:18.390 --> 29:19.579
Let's look for your name again.

29:19.599 --> 29:20.879
Double-check.

29:21.119 --> 29:22.520
Shi Chanli.

29:22.599 --> 29:24.919
Shi Chanli.

29:33.879 --> 29:36.919
I made it too!

29:37.399 --> 29:39.119
I passed!

29:39.319 --> 29:40.679
I passed!

29:55.280 --> 29:56.439
No, please.

29:57.919 --> 29:59.299
Congratulations

29:59.319 --> 30:00.520
on your success.

30:02.200 --> 30:03.560
If you study hard again,

30:03.680 --> 30:06.059
you will surely make it next time.

30:06.079 --> 30:07.680
Thanks for the encouraging words.

30:12.319 --> 30:13.399
Yang.

30:17.639 --> 30:19.190
Now that the results are out,

30:19.210 --> 30:20.720
everything has settled down.

30:21.079 --> 30:22.879
It's time to pay Mr. Fan a visit, right?

30:23.599 --> 30:24.800
Of course.

30:25.159 --> 30:26.460
If so,

30:26.480 --> 30:27.879
we can visit him

30:28.359 --> 30:29.919
without concerns.

30:30.040 --> 30:31.879
I'm going to find Jialing.

30:32.033 --> 30:33.113
Jialing!

30:35.680 --> 30:36.879
You made it!

30:37.040 --> 30:38.399
Cheng Jialing!

30:39.119 --> 30:40.299
I will join you.

30:40.319 --> 30:41.599
Even though I failed,

30:41.879 --> 30:43.359
I should go and thank him.

30:43.800 --> 30:45.159
Of course you should.

30:54.919 --> 30:57.460
Let's rehearse again.

30:57.480 --> 30:59.679
No need. We have already
done that many times.

31:03.200 --> 31:04.280
He's here.

31:09.919 --> 31:13.460
Three, two, one.

31:13.480 --> 31:14.599
Greetings...

31:14.599 --> 31:16.099
Mr...

31:16.119 --> 31:17.020
Fan...

31:17.040 --> 31:18.120
Fan...

31:19.280 --> 31:21.550
You two were not in unison.
You can't blame me for that.

31:22.119 --> 31:23.639
We had a joyful conversation last time.

31:23.639 --> 31:24.980
Why are you so nervous now?

31:25.000 --> 31:27.180
We didn't know you were Mr. Fan.

31:27.200 --> 31:28.280
Yes.

31:28.359 --> 31:29.619
Still, I'm an ordinary man.

31:29.639 --> 31:31.159
No, you are not.

31:34.800 --> 31:36.359
You are the Immortal Poet.

31:36.839 --> 31:38.980
Shi Chanli.

31:39.000 --> 31:39.880
What's wrong?

31:39.900 --> 31:41.280
No need for the long pause.

31:42.159 --> 31:44.040
What brings you here?

31:44.800 --> 31:46.500
Mr. Fan, you are the supervisor
of the spring exam.

31:46.520 --> 31:47.579
We should

31:47.599 --> 31:50.720
pay our respect to you as students.

31:52.839 --> 31:54.590
Are you seeking an apprenticeship?

31:54.960 --> 31:58.300
Mr. Fan, you are mighty and courageous
to combat the corruption in the exam.

31:58.320 --> 31:59.579
You deserve our respect.

31:59.599 --> 32:01.090
The four of us truly admire you

32:01.110 --> 32:02.679
and would offer our services.

32:05.399 --> 32:06.479
Four?

32:06.880 --> 32:09.059
The crowd injured Cheng Jialing
while checking the ranking list.

32:09.079 --> 32:09.920
He can't move right now.

32:09.940 --> 32:12.520
He asked us to convey his respect to you.

32:14.639 --> 32:17.079
Three of you made it.

32:17.280 --> 32:19.260
The final ranking will be determined
after the palace exam.

32:19.280 --> 32:22.079
But before that, you are officials now.

32:22.520 --> 32:24.760
I couldn't accept the bow
without returning favors.

32:24.839 --> 32:26.560
I prepared some guidance

32:26.879 --> 32:27.940
of being an official

32:27.960 --> 32:29.079
for you.

32:31.190 --> 32:32.870
I have written what I want to say

32:32.960 --> 32:34.200
on it.

32:34.760 --> 32:35.840
You may go.

32:36.879 --> 32:37.959
Mr. Fan...

32:39.639 --> 32:40.719
Sir,

32:40.879 --> 32:41.940
I shall take my leave.

32:41.960 --> 32:43.919
Sir, I shall take my leave.

32:45.480 --> 32:46.560
Shi Chanli.

32:47.520 --> 32:48.600
You stay.

32:58.475 --> 33:03.995
[Fan's Residence]

33:22.520 --> 33:23.859
Be an honest man.

33:23.879 --> 33:25.520
Be an honest official.

33:26.720 --> 33:28.099
As expected of Mr. Fan.

33:28.119 --> 33:29.299
What a choice of words.

33:29.319 --> 33:30.460
Precise

33:30.480 --> 33:31.539
and profound.

33:31.559 --> 33:32.639
Hou.

33:33.079 --> 33:34.539
You see, the word "man"

33:34.559 --> 33:36.180
is written before the word "official".

33:36.200 --> 33:38.020
Yang, from today on,

33:38.040 --> 33:39.879
we are the disciples of the Fans.

33:40.159 --> 33:43.280
We should keep this in mind
and not disappoint Mr. Fan.

34:06.079 --> 34:07.159
Mr. Fan.

34:08.240 --> 34:09.479
I failed.

34:11.399 --> 34:12.479
I know.

34:22.240 --> 34:23.839
I have let down your guidance.

34:24.460 --> 34:26.580
No need to feel ashamed
if you have done your best.

34:28.240 --> 34:29.519
You are right, Mr. Fan.

34:32.800 --> 34:34.479
Do you keep me here

34:35.080 --> 34:36.600
for any orders?

34:39.160 --> 34:40.720
What's your next plan?

34:41.359 --> 34:42.559
Well,

34:43.280 --> 34:45.399
I will leave the Capital in a few days.

34:45.640 --> 34:46.839
I'm going back home.

34:49.080 --> 34:50.359
You can't.

34:52.200 --> 34:55.080
The Shijia Town
was burned to the ground.

34:55.999 --> 34:57.620
This is the disaster report

34:57.640 --> 34:58.939
issued by the local yamen.

34:58.959 --> 35:00.039
Have a look at it.

35:09.399 --> 35:11.039
This fire

35:11.600 --> 35:13.200
might not be a natural disaster.

35:34.675 --> 35:38.220
[Shijia Town]

35:47.999 --> 35:49.080
Mr. Fan.

36:03.600 --> 36:05.160
He Zongwei requests an audience.

36:08.399 --> 36:09.620
Take him somewhere else.

36:09.640 --> 36:10.939
I will see him later.

36:10.959 --> 36:12.080
Yes, Mr. Fan.

36:38.999 --> 36:40.079
Mr. Fan.

36:41.839 --> 36:43.240
He Zongwei,

36:43.359 --> 36:44.600
we met again.

36:45.080 --> 36:46.240
"Educated men

36:46.720 --> 36:47.959
can't bend their knees,

36:48.399 --> 36:49.879
nor should they."

36:50.600 --> 36:52.600
I'm much enlightened

36:52.640 --> 36:54.280
by your reprimand.

36:54.359 --> 36:57.040
Hence, I would like to express
my gratitude here.

36:57.399 --> 36:59.879
I didn't see you during the spring exam.

37:04.519 --> 37:06.559
I should've taken the exam.

37:07.319 --> 37:11.120
However, something in this world
is more important than that.

37:12.479 --> 37:14.819
You studied for years
to become an official.

37:14.839 --> 37:16.220
Is there something

37:16.240 --> 37:17.839
more important than this?

37:18.240 --> 37:19.600
Needless to say,

37:20.800 --> 37:22.499
it's an unjust

37:22.519 --> 37:24.479
death!

37:32.399 --> 37:34.660
You should go to the yamen.

37:34.680 --> 37:36.320
Yes, we should've gone there.

37:37.359 --> 37:40.160
But we heard that you are handling
the spring exam corruption cases.

37:40.399 --> 37:41.600
Only you

37:42.760 --> 37:44.459
could help us with our grievance.

37:44.479 --> 37:46.080
It concerns the spring exam?

37:46.999 --> 37:48.499
The husband of this woman

37:48.519 --> 37:50.540
was a candidate
who failed the last spring exam.

37:50.560 --> 37:53.720
This aggrieved man should've
been admitted for his great talents.

37:53.800 --> 37:55.032
Ironically,

37:55.052 --> 37:57.333
someone replaced him
and stole his position.

37:57.359 --> 37:59.479
And worst of all,
he found out about that.

37:59.800 --> 38:01.865
He couldn't accept the reality

38:01.885 --> 38:03.126
and wanted

38:03.359 --> 38:04.899
to seek justice for himself.

38:04.919 --> 38:05.979
Go on.

38:05.999 --> 38:10.030
The impostor turned out to be a disciple
of the court official.

38:10.800 --> 38:12.939
Unexpectedly, the official

38:12.959 --> 38:14.499
killed this candidate.

38:14.519 --> 38:15.459
As of now,

38:15.479 --> 38:17.220
only his widow remains,

38:17.240 --> 38:18.680
who never gives up

38:18.839 --> 38:20.680
to seek justice for her late husband.

38:22.399 --> 38:23.600
He Zongwei,

38:23.800 --> 38:25.280
does this case

38:25.479 --> 38:26.419
concern you?

38:26.439 --> 38:28.519
I have a conscience.

38:29.359 --> 38:30.879
Upon hearing this,

38:30.959 --> 38:32.600
I left the Capital immediately

38:32.800 --> 38:34.359
and went to great lengths
to find this widow

38:34.359 --> 38:35.760
and bring her here.

38:36.359 --> 38:37.299
Mr. Fan,

38:37.319 --> 38:38.540
among all officials,

38:38.560 --> 38:40.299
only you

38:40.319 --> 38:42.519
stand up for the candidates.

38:43.240 --> 38:45.680
So I brought her here.

38:45.839 --> 38:47.559
Did you give up the spring exam

38:47.919 --> 38:49.100
because of this?

38:49.120 --> 38:50.640
An innocent man died unjustly,

38:51.153 --> 38:52.633
how could I back off?

38:58.160 --> 38:59.640
Do you know

38:59.919 --> 39:02.280
which court official
killed your husband?

39:02.479 --> 39:04.080
I do.

39:04.160 --> 39:05.439
Tell me.

39:05.879 --> 39:08.030
The murder
behind the spring exam corruption,

39:08.280 --> 39:10.399
who killed my husband, was

39:10.999 --> 39:13.120
the current prime minister,

39:13.519 --> 39:15.280
Lin Ruofu.

39:20.039 --> 39:21.640
Everyone admires you

39:21.720 --> 39:22.760
for your justice action.

39:22.780 --> 39:24.750
The impartial official
who would forsake personal relationships

39:24.760 --> 39:26.060
for justice

39:26.080 --> 39:28.959
is only you, Mr. Fan Xian.

39:38.359 --> 39:40.519
Surely, an isolated official.

39:45.080 --> 39:45.819
Mr. Yan.

39:45.839 --> 39:46.919
Mr. Yan.

39:53.000 --> 39:53.720
What's the matter?

39:53.720 --> 39:57.245
[Imperial Inspectorate First Division]

39:58.640 --> 40:01.540
A student brought the victim's family
to accuse Prime Minster Lin of murder.

40:01.560 --> 40:02.780
I learned of the case.

40:02.800 --> 40:03.819
Why did you ask for me here?

40:03.839 --> 40:05.130
The deceased isn't in the Capital.

40:05.150 --> 40:06.899
I need assistance
from the Fourth Division.

40:06.919 --> 40:07.999
Not enough.

40:08.340 --> 40:10.580
You also need the Ministry of Justice,
the Court of Judicial Review,

40:10.600 --> 40:11.660
and the Capital Magistrate.

40:11.680 --> 40:12.899
I won't hand over the victim.

40:12.919 --> 40:13.980
I know.

40:14.000 --> 40:16.150
The Imperial Inspectorate
will lead the case.

40:16.319 --> 40:18.379
I'm not familiar
with other departments.

40:18.399 --> 40:19.140
How about this?

40:19.160 --> 40:20.620
You will deal

40:20.640 --> 40:21.959
with these departments.

40:23.080 --> 40:24.359
Have you thought

40:24.479 --> 40:26.170
about what you would do

40:26.190 --> 40:27.850
if the accusation proved to be true?

40:29.999 --> 40:32.559
You chucked the Elder Princess out,

40:32.600 --> 40:34.160
and now it's Prime Minster Lin.

40:34.310 --> 40:36.080
How are you going to face Princess Lin?

40:37.720 --> 40:39.200
What do you suggest?

40:41.760 --> 40:43.067
Hand the case over

40:43.087 --> 40:44.419
to me.

40:44.439 --> 40:45.740
Are you worried about me?

40:45.760 --> 40:47.280
No, you might show favoritism.

40:49.720 --> 40:50.780
Thanks.

40:50.800 --> 40:52.060
But this case

40:52.080 --> 40:53.399
must be handled by me.

40:53.640 --> 40:54.620
Reason being?

40:54.640 --> 40:57.559
His Majesty appointed me to investigate
the spring exam corruption.

40:58.039 --> 40:59.399
I can't withdraw from it.

40:59.919 --> 41:01.680
Do you think His Majesty knows

41:02.000 --> 41:03.879
about Prime Minster Lin's case
in advance?

41:08.200 --> 41:09.439
Perish that thought.

41:09.999 --> 41:11.200
It's too dangerous.

41:13.560 --> 41:14.500
Where are you going?

41:14.520 --> 41:16.070
The Prime Minister's Residence.

41:16.800 --> 41:18.590
Are you sure you want to go there now?

41:23.720 --> 41:25.120
Please come in.

41:27.039 --> 41:28.019
Here you go.

41:28.039 --> 41:28.819
Have a good day.

41:28.839 --> 41:30.640
Sure. I will wrap it up for you.

41:30.675 --> 41:33.545
[Tingyu Restaurant]

41:33.999 --> 41:36.030
Mr. Yuan, you are here.
Please come in. There is a premium seat.

41:36.050 --> 41:36.899
Please have some tea.

41:36.919 --> 41:37.780
Nice tea.

41:37.800 --> 41:39.479
Yes, it tastes fresh.

41:40.080 --> 41:41.760
Ornament for sale!

41:43.640 --> 41:45.640
Ornament!

41:46.479 --> 41:48.550
Mr. Yuan, there's a premium seat here.

41:48.600 --> 41:49.759
No need.

41:56.319 --> 41:57.979
Waiter, two orders of beef.

41:57.999 --> 41:59.720
Sure, sir. Right away.

42:00.479 --> 42:02.439
Yogurt for sale!

42:03.200 --> 42:03.899
I will sit here.

42:03.919 --> 42:04.999
Sure.

42:05.200 --> 42:07.280
A pot of tea and two orders of nuts.

42:07.359 --> 42:08.180
All right.

42:08.200 --> 42:09.879
Is it going to rain?

42:14.359 --> 42:16.559
Why are the windows closed?

42:17.000 --> 42:18.250
There is a river down there

42:18.270 --> 42:20.520
swarming with mosquitoes,
so we had them closed.

42:22.399 --> 42:23.479
Open them.

42:27.319 --> 42:28.959
Flowers for sale!

42:29.319 --> 42:31.320
Fresh flowers.

42:33.439 --> 42:35.720
Do you plan to stand there all day long?

42:37.519 --> 42:39.519
Don't pull a long face.

42:39.999 --> 42:41.320
Young man,

42:41.680 --> 42:43.200
you can't afford to be down.

42:46.190 --> 42:47.600
Someone reported you to me.

42:47.720 --> 42:49.879
Was it about me silencing someone?

42:50.519 --> 42:51.800
I've heard about it.

42:57.439 --> 42:58.600
Did you do it?

43:16.260 --> 43:18.260
♪ The youth raises his head ♪

43:18.260 --> 43:22.340
♪ As he moves toward his moon ♪

43:23.860 --> 43:25.980
♪ People tease him for being delusional ♪

43:25.980 --> 43:29.760
♪ Wondering why he is so unconventional ♪

43:31.780 --> 43:35.340
♪ Wearing a white robe
when crossing a muddy pond ♪

43:35.340 --> 43:39.260
♪ How could it remain unstained? ♪

43:39.260 --> 43:41.180
♪ If silver tael has a value ♪

43:41.180 --> 43:44.780
♪ Who can truly be carefree? ♪

43:45.500 --> 43:48.180
♪ All of you are right ♪

43:48.200 --> 43:50.420
♪ He said: "Please" ♪

43:50.420 --> 43:53.480
♪ "Make way" ♪

43:53.500 --> 43:55.980
♪ "Let me drink until I drop" ♪

43:55.980 --> 43:57.900
♪ On the court ♪

43:57.900 --> 44:00.920
♪ I recite several verses ♪

44:00.940 --> 44:03.340
♪ Let me wear a white robe ♪

44:03.340 --> 44:05.420
♪ And cross the alley
filled with insanity ♪

44:05.420 --> 44:08.640
♪ To scoop up the moon's reflection
in the muddy pond ♪

44:08.660 --> 44:10.900
♪ Sirs, please forgive me ♪

44:10.900 --> 44:12.860
♪ Your words of advice ♪

44:12.860 --> 44:15.880
♪ I understand,
but I don't want to pretend ♪

44:15.900 --> 44:18.190
♪ People search for the golden land ♪

44:18.190 --> 44:20.260
♪ While I search for the moon ♪

44:20.260 --> 44:22.720
♪ Why should we travel together? ♪

44:22.740 --> 44:24.660
♪ Thank you ♪

44:24.660 --> 44:26.740
♪ Excuse me ♪

44:26.740 --> 44:28.420
♪ You are you ♪

44:28.420 --> 44:30.320
♪ I am me ♪

44:30.340 --> 44:32.260
♪ Thank you ♪

44:32.260 --> 44:34.220
♪ Excuse me ♪

44:34.220 --> 44:36.020
♪ You are you ♪

44:36.020 --> 44:39.480
♪ I am me ♪

44:51.550 --> 44:54.770
♪ Wearing a white robe
when crossing a muddy pond ♪

44:55.150 --> 44:58.620
♪ Remarkably worldly-wise
yet hopelessly romantic ♪

44:58.870 --> 45:02.010
♪ Know what you love ♪

45:02.200 --> 45:04.770
♪ Don't change ♪

45:06.660 --> 45:10.090
♪ If one has witnessed
both light and shadow ♪

45:10.167 --> 45:13.790
♪ Yet retains their innocence ♪

45:13.810 --> 45:16.840
♪ They shall be cloaked in moonlight ♪

45:16.900 --> 45:20.100
♪ As they journey through the night ♪
